<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Thief Spells</h1>
<p>The few spells the Thieves' guild teaches, in its hall in Midgaard. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the spell there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>). Each spell has its own help: help and the spell's name.
</p>
<pre>Name      Level   Up to
Quicken      35   50%
Unlock       35   50%
Lock         40   50%
</pre>
<p><br />
